Gilgamesh Linux live / install environment

The Go installer starts once on tty1. Run gilgamesh-install to start it again.
Manual legacy Bash fallback: gilgamesh-install-bash (uses stock linux).
Use Alt+F2 for a rescue shell. Installation requires UEFI and internet access.

Wired DHCP connects automatically. Use iwctl for Wi-Fi or mmcli for mobile broadband.
Installation_guide opens the Arch Linux reference guide.
